sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as SMTP submission
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Queue worker
  participant MX as Remote MX
  C->>S: SMTP transaction / API request
  S->>DB: Commit message, envelope, idempotency, outbox
  DB-->>S: Commit confirmed
  S-->>C: 250 accepted
  Q->>DB: Claim due row with lease
  Q->>MX: Connect, EHLO, STARTTLS, MAIL/RCPT/DATA
  alt Remote 2xx
    MX-->>Q: 2xx accepted
    Q->>DB: Commit delivered_to_next_hop with lease
  else Temporary/ambiguous
    MX-->>Q: timeout or 4xx
    Q->>DB: Commit deferred/ambiguous with retry schedule
  else Permanent
    MX-->>Q: 5xx
    Q->>DB: Commit permanent failure and bounce event
  end
